## 1. Login flow and credentials

### A. Web UI: name + phone (not LINE ID)

`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/ParentPortal.vue` — form fields and `login()` call `parentLogin` with `Name` and `Phone`:

```21:35:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/ParentPortal.vue
